WEBVTT

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.580
Hello, Ichijou residence.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.500
Komari-senpai!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.110
Yes, it sure is hot today.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.110
What? Our free study projects?

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:25.740
<i>Yeah, Natsumi made me hold some "magic hand" 
and said her robot was complete.</i>

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.050
<i>I really wish she'd give me a break...</i>

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.350
That must have been crazy.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.410
<i>Well, anyway, are you free today?</i>

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:38.230
Oh... My parents are out shopping, 
so I need to watch the house...

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.170
And I have some things I need to do...

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
But how about tomorrow?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.460
I'll be free then.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.890
<i>Okay, tomorrow it is. 
I'll invite the others, too.</i>

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.040
<i>See ya.</i>

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.070
Okay.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.870
Our free study projects...

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.640
I'll have to finish mine today.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.100
I've already put the 
walking robot together,

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.090
so now I just need to use 
the laptop Dad lent me

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:14.320
to load the spoken lines 
into the talking robot.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:18.620
I'll just put in some simple 
words for starters...

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:25.020
And now... I just put these two robots...

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.120
inside this...

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:59.510
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.460
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.460
<b>I Made Something Incredible</b>

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.170
Hold it!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:16.180
My robot masterpiece, 
Komaringar V Version 2!

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:19.990
Seriously, don't make me 
your free study project!

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:25.090
There. Now to test it in an open space.

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.050
Switch on!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:29.910
<i>I...</i>

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:37.510
<i>I am... Koma-plushie...</i>

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:44.120
A-Amazing! My Koma-plushie 
is talking and moving!

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:50.290
<i>I am... Koma-plushie...</i>

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.040
No, Pechi! Stop barking at it!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.060
Come over here.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:54.780
It's just a stuffed toy. Don't be scared.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.470
Look, Pechi, just watch!

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.250
When this Koma-plushie

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.720
is about to run into a wall...

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.570
<i>Dead end.</i>

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:08.510
Look! It changes direction 
to avoid the wall!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.920
Isn't that amazing?!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.940
There's an infrared sensor 
in the dog's nose,

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.330
so it can tell when there's 
a wall in the way!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.980
So even if it comes toward 
you, it'll turn and...

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.180
Huh? It didn't turn?

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.080
Maybe it only works on flat walls...

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:31.030
But you didn't bark this time. 
Good boy, Pechi.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.200
Oh, someone's here.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.640
I'll go see who it is.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.040
Don't do anything mean 
to the Koma-plushie, okay?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.600
<i>Koma-plushie.</i>

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:58.340
<i>I am... Koma-plushie.</i>

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:03.870
<i>I am... Koma-plu—</i>

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.970
<i>...shie.</i>

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.780
<i>Koma-plushie.</i>

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:22.590
<i>I am... Koma-plushie.</i>

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.410
<i>Dead end.</i>

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.870
Sorry to make you wait, Pechi.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.930
They gave me the neighborhood bulletin, 
then we got to talking...

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.290
Huh? Where's the Koma-plushie?

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:59.550
The Koma-plushie... didn't go 
outside or anything, did it?

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.970
My Koma-plushie escaped!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:26.200
<i>Koma-plushie.</i>

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.980
<i>Koma-plushie.</i>

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:17.030
<i>I am... Koma-plushie.</i>

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:27.920
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.890
Wait... You can't be serious...

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.920
It's Aka-chan!

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.640
Aka-chan!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.950
R-Renge-chan.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.660
You're using that weird nickname again.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.680
Call me Akane.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:44.110
I can't use it? But it's cute.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.550
Anyway, why were you just 
standing around out here?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.840
Aren't you going to Konomi-chan's house?

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.460
Oh... uh... I was going to, but...

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.230
I was going to, but...

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.490
Um... well...

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.490
I got the date wrong!

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:10.700
I practiced so hard at 
home yesterday for this,

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:14.790
then I looked at my phone just now and 
realized our practice is tomorrow!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.600
I'm so embarrassed at myself for practicing

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.860
until I got all confident and 
taking the train out here...

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.290
I see.

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.080
But if you talk to Konomi-nee,

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.170
she'll still play with you today.

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:30.900
I'll go get her.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.870
Ah... W-Wait!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.680
What's wrong?

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:39.200
If Senpai found out that 
I got the date wrong,

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.460
it'd be kind of embarrassing...

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:44.490
I'll just go home for today...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.900
I know!

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:53.720
Since you're here, you can play with 
me like a fish that just found water!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.620
Found... water?

00:08:55.620 --> 00:09:00.890
W-Well, sure, I can play... 
but what should we play?

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:10.760
Salt...

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.500
I'm a slug that just found salt.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.320
That's pretty different from 
what you said earlier...

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.680
I guess you weren't too fond of that game.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.340
Oh, uh... yeah...

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:26.140
What do you usually play 
outside, Akane-chin?

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:30.660
When I was little, I played things 
like hopscotch and jump rope...

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:33.200
Hopscotch? What's that?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.140
Huh? You don't know?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.730
You draw circles on the 
ground and jump into them.

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.390
Ooh! That sounds fun!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.540
Let's do that!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:46.160
Oh, but Senpai might notice 
if we play right here,

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.310
so let's move...

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:54.200
You draw circles like this,

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.960
then jump from one to the next 
without stepping outside them.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.840
Okay, I'll try it!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.660
You can watch my brave exploits!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.200
Okay, sure.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.800
Hop! Hop!

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.220
Not like that, Renge-chan.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.840
You use your feet to—

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.340
Scotch!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:20.270
N-Not like that! 
That's not how you play it!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:22.790
You said to use my feet, though.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.520
That's not how you're supposed to use them!

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.240
Like this.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.330
You just jump with your feet.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.470
I get it now.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.890
Hop... hop... scotch!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.890
Hop... scotch! Hop... scotch!

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:42.510
Hop... hop... scotch!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:50.000
It's pretty hot for playing outside.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.470
Want to have some water at my house?

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:56.220
Yeah, I'd appreciate that.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.250
Okay, come with me to my house—

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.880
Hey, Renge-chan.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.350
Another hot day today, huh?

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:06.250
What are you doing here by yourself?

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.580
Oh, I was playing hopscotch.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.940
Hopscotch? Oh, I see now.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:16.610
Hey, I know. If you're alone, 
want to come to my house?

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.300
It's so hot outside.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.780
That's okay. I wanna play 
a little more first.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.190
Oh...

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.400
Okay, then, want to play hide-and-seek 
for a little while?

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.870
I'll hide, so you try to find me.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:34.950
B-But... it's dangerous to play 
hide-and-seek right now.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:37.280
What are you talking about, Renge-chan?

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:40.550
Go on, cover your eyes and start counting.

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:47.000
One... Two... Three...

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.000
Okay, where should I hide?

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:51.010
Four... Five... Six...

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:51.010
<i>Hmm... Maybe just behind this tree?</i>

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:57.480
Seven... Eight... Nine... Ten... Eleven...

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.480
<i>Thank goodness I hid in the grass.</i>

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.330
Twelve... Thirteen...

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:01.320
Hey, wait! Renge-chan!

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:04.580
Look at this! There's a 
game trail right here!

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:07.010
Maybe a wild rabbit just passed by,

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:09.050
or maybe a baby deer...

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.340
What do you think? Want to look for it?

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.770
B-But I'd feel bad if we scared it.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:18.160
And it might already be gone, anyway.

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.210
Yeah, I guess so.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.100
Ready to continue our game, then?

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.990
<i>I'm safe! Thanks, Renge-cha—</i>

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:27.780
Hey!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.540
Ren-chon and Konomi-chan!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.380
What're you playing?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.280
Hey, Nacchan.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:38.890
We were about to play hide-and-seek, 
but then we found a game trail.

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:41.590
I was just saying a wild 
rabbit might've made it.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.200
What? Really?!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.160
All right! Let's catch it!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.810
Is this the trail?

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.370
Whoa! Something moved!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.820
So it's still close by!

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:58.720
Okay, I'm gonna go after it! Follow me!

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.170
This way!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.800
It went in there! Hold up!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.140
<i>Why did this happen?!</i>

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.070
<i>I'll be embarrassed to death 
if they find me now!</i>

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:11.830
<i>But I'm super fast at running away,</i>

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.580
<i>so I'll just outrun them!</i>

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:35.590
You ended up like a slug 
that found salt anyway.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.770
Not a slug...

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:42.780
But... could I get some water 
from your house, Senpai?

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:46.810
Sure, but... what are you 
doing out here, Akane-chan?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.510
What a rough day.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:06.640
I wasn't expecting to be mistaken for a 
wild animal while playing hopscotch.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:12.300
But at least Konomi-senpai wasn't bothered 
by it and practiced with me anyway...

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:17.420
What was that?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.040
There's something in the grass...

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.800
Maybe there really is a wild animal?

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:27.030
<i>I-It's a cat or something, right?</i>

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:30.010
<i>What if it's an animal 
I've never seen before?</i>

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:41.390
<i>I am... Koma-plushie.</i>

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:55.180
I'm so glad you came back home!

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.550
Nobody saw you, right?

00:14:56.370 --> 00:15:03.380
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.870
Hello, Ichijou residence.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:10.820
Komari-senpai!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:15.900
Oh, right now? Yes! I'll be right there!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:19.370
I-I-It's nice to see you again...

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:23.410
U-Um... What shall we do today?

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:28.030
Um, we're both younger than you,

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.310
so you don't need to be so polite.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.700
Wha... Ah... Oh, yeah, you're right...

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.710
And you don't need to be polite, either.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.880
I haven't seen you since that last time,

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:39.540
so I thought it'd be nice 
to hang out again.

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:44.470
I was a little nervous since 
Konomi-senpai isn't here today...

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:49.140
B-But I'm okay now. 
Thank you for inviting me over.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:52.390
Not at all. We should thank 
you for coming all this way.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:56.780
You go to the same school 
as Konomi-san, right?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.380
Oh... Yeah. We're in the same club, too.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.890
High school must be so cool!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.890
It's more like city life 
there than here, right?

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.100
Do you hang out with 
Konomi-san at school, too?

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:10.370
Oh... N-No.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:14.740
We're in different grades, so I don't 
see her during breaks that often,

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.770
but on club days, we sometimes 
walk home together partway.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:22.460
Oh, yeah, you practice with 
Konomi-chan a lot, huh?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:27.080
Is something wrong? 
Why are you staring at me?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:31.480
N-No, nothing! Something completely 
unrelated just came to my mind...

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:33.840
Really? What? I wanna know!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.060
I'd like to know, too!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:40.410
Well, it really has nothing 
to do with anything...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.460
And I feel like things would 
get weird if I said it...

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.890
Aw, nah, it's fine.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.600
Natsumi says weird stuff 
all the time already.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.570
Don't laugh, okay?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.740
Last time I was here...

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.000
When I was on my way home,

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.740
something that looked like a miniature 
Komari-chan popped out of the bushes...

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.180
Wait, what was it? A ghost?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.680
I-It startled me, too, 
so I ran away on the spot.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.920
And now I don't remember it very clearly...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.210
Uh... How big was it?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:16.190
Um... About like this, I think.

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.080
W-Wait, did it have legs?

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:21.140
A ghost wouldn't have legs...

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:24.520
Legs... It did have legs.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:29.290
Actually, it was riding on some kind 
of animal that had four legs,

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.470
so it had six?

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:31.280
Six?!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.340
<i>That was definitely...</i>

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.410
<i>my Mecha Koma-plushie!</i>

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:41.090
Oh, but the thing riding on it that 
looked like you had two legs.

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:44.750
B-But why was there a tiny 
person that looked like me?

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:48.650
Was it some kind of vengeful 
spirit or doppelganger?!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.070
<i>Wh-What do I do?!</i>

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.130
<i>I can't just come out and say 
it's a robotic Koma-plushie!</i>

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.010
What do you think, Hotaru?!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.090
Huh?! Me?!

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:03.050
Why don't we... talk about 
beetles or something instead?

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.810
What? Why?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:08.600
I mean, if it was just a ghost story, 
I wouldn't want to hear it,

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.780
<i>but if it looked like me, 
that just makes me curious...</i>

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:13.300
R-Right...

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:16.000
If it's a ghost with some connection to me,

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.160
it might come for me eventually!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.420
Just picture it, Hotaru!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:24.120
What would you do if that ghost 
showed up here right now?!

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:25.760
I'd cry.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:26.580
Right?!

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.760
So I need to hear more about it!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.910
We might figure out that it was 
something else you mistook for me!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:38.580
Uh... I-I'm sorry for talking 
about something so weird...

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.710
No, it's okay. You did warn us.

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.570
You said it was riding on 
an animal or something.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:47.280
Does that mean it was some kind of yokai?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.470
Um, I think...

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:51.790
What was it again?

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.470
A tsuchinoko... with hands and feet?

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.410
What?! A tsuchinoko?!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.230
So it <i>was</i> something like that...

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:03.130
I-If it was really a tsuchinoko, 
that's basically a yokai...

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:07.710
Uh, b-but... a tsuchinoko with hands 
and feet doesn't make sense.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:10.410
It might've been a great 
salamander or something...

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.920
That's it!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:15.390
It must've actually been 
a giant salamander!

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:20.750
Okay! So the thing it was riding on wasn't 
a yokai! It just looked like one!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.640
Y-Yeah, I guess so...

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.840
U-Um...

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:30.930
Could the animal have been 
a dog, by any chance?

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:34.390
A dog? It didn't look like one...

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:38.010
<i>Huh? So maybe it wasn't 
the Mecha Koma-plushie,</i>

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.750
<i>and she really is talking 
about something else?</i>

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.350
Did you notice anything else about it?

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.570
It made a noise like "Koma-pluh..."

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:47.480
So it <i>was</i> a dog!

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:50.110
Where'd that come from, Hotaru?

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:52.500
Dogs don't make that noise.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.330
Ah... eh... uh... I...

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:01.300
D-Dogs sound more like that than you'd 
think... when they're growling...

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:03.310
R-Really?

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:06.670
I've never heard one that 
sounded like that.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:13.400
U-U-U-Um... Like...

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:20.060
Koma-pluh!

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.340
It's kind of like that.

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:26.760
Uh... I see...

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.500
You didn't really have to 
give a demonstration...

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:36.020
But "Koma-pluh" kinda has part 
of my name in it, doesn't it?

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:39.000
Koma-pluh...

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:45.440
Wait... Hotaru, didn't you... 
make a plushie of me?

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.340
Really?

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.450
Yeah, for our class project 
over summer break.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.460
Th-Th-Th-Th-That's right!

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:55.500
We all made them together!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.970
W-Would you like to make 
one, too, Akane-san?

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:05.960
That reaction... Does it mean...

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.230
you know something?

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.860
I'm sorry, Senpai! I actually—

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:16.620
Hotaru!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.320
You don't have to say anything!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:25.370
I get it now! A great salamander's ghost 
possessed the plushie you made!

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:31.170
I have a plan I've been holding 
on to for situations like this!

00:21:31.170 --> 00:21:32.800
Don't worry, Hotaru!

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:35.480
I'll go get the stuff we need for it!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.360
Wait right there, Hotaru!

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:44.420
I'm home...

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:46.780
Welcome home.

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.390
Dinner is almost ready. 
Go on and wash your hands.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.660
Okay.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.740
Hotaru-chan, what is that?

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:00.350
Komari-senpai gave me salt 
to set out for good luck.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.710
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:13.430
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:36.690
Rhino, rhino, rhinoceros, 
rhinoceros beetles...

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:41.290
Big, shiny rhinoceros beetles...

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:45.700
Big, smooth rhinoceros beetles...

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.900
<b>Next Time 
Episode 6</b>

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.900
<b>We All Went Camping Together</b>

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:54.410
Photo: Komagitsune

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Please Watch Again</b>

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Nonstop</b>
